Tourists.

Rogues, Rangers, Cavemen and Tourists may get a different pet at the
start of the game. This is from Rob Ellwood's "Exotic Pets" patch.

If you put "OPTIONS=pettype:e" in your rc file, those classes will
always get an exotic pet.

